    "notes": ["Header order: Ai-Thinker's ESP-01 and ESP-01S dimension drawings (seen from the component side with the antenna up: inner row GND, IO2, IO0, RXD; edge row TXD, EN, RST, VCC). The ESP-01S label grid printed on the back is the mirror image of this (ESP01-SPEC)(ESP01S-SPEC)","Boot table: download mode = EN high, RST high, GPIO15 low, GPIO0 low, GPIO2 high, TXD high; run mode is the same with GPIO0 high (ESP01S-SPEC)","ESP-01S schematic: pull-ups on RST, EN and IO0, pull-down on GPIO15, blue LED from 3.3 V into IO2 (ESP01S-SPEC)","The 2-page ESP-01 spec has no schematic, so do not assume an ESP-01 has the ESP-01S pull-ups and LED (ESP01-SPEC)","Supply 3.0-3.6 V. ESP-01: supply must give more than 300 mA (transmit peaks reach 300 mA); ESP-01S: more than 500 mA recommended (ESP01-SPEC)(ESP01S-SPEC)","Input high must not exceed 3.6 V (ESP8266-DS)"],
    "sources": [{"title":"ESP01-SPEC: Ai-Thinker, ESP-01 802.11 b/g/n Wi-Fi Module V1.2 specification (2 pages, dimension drawing)","url":"https://aithinker-static.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/docs/Public%20Document%20Center/WiFi/esp8266/Specification/ESP-01%20Specification-20220807.pdf"},{"title":"ESP01S-SPEC: Ai-Thinker, ESP-01S Specification V1.1 (dimensions, pin definition, boot modes, schematic)","url":"https://aithinker-static.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/docs/Public%20Document%20Center/WiFi/esp8266/Specification/ESP-01S%20Specification-20250802.pdf"},{"title":"ESP8266-DS: Espressif, ESP8266EX Datasheet (pin definitions, I/O levels)","url":"https://www.espressif.com/sites/default/files/documentation/0a-esp8266ex_datasheet_en.pdf"}],
