    "notes": ["Header order: Raspberry Pi's Pico pinout (pins 1-20 down the left, 21-40 up the right, USB at the top); the Pico W pinout and the Pico 2 datasheet figure use the same header (PICO-PINOUT)(PICOW-PINOUT)(PICO2-DS)","Every GPIO can do PWM and PIO (PICO-PINOUT)","Pico and Pico 2 use these internally (not on the header): GP23 SMPS power-save, GP24 VBUS sense, GP25 user LED, GP29 VSYS/3 on ADC3 (PICO-DS)(PICO2-DS)","Pico W: GP23, GP24, GP25 and GP29 drive the CYW43439 wireless chip; the LED, VBUS sense and SMPS power-save move to the wireless chip (WL_GPIO0, WL_GPIO2, WL_GPIO1) (PICOW-DS)","Pico W: the 3-pin SWD debug header sits in the middle of the board instead of at the end, and the antenna is at the end away from USB; keep metal away from it (PICOW-PINOUT)(PICOW-DS)","Flashing: unplug, hold BOOTSEL while plugging in USB, then copy a .uf2 file onto the USB drive that appears (PICO-DS)","VSYS takes 1.8-5.5 V; VBUS feeds VSYS through a Schottky diode (PICO-DS)","GPIO is fixed at 3.3 V. GP26-28 (ADC) must not exceed 3.3 V + about 300 mV, and leak into the 3.3 V rail when the board is unpowered (PICO-DS)","RP2040 (Pico, Pico W): absolute maximum on any I/O is IOVDD + 0.5 V, so not 5 V tolerant (RP2040-DS)","RP2350 (Pico 2): GPIO0-25 tolerate up to 5.5 V only while the chip is powered at 3.3 V; GP26-29 do not (RP2350-DS)","RP2350 stepping A2 (early Pico 2): erratum E9 lets a floating input with the internal pull-down sit near 2.2 V; use an external pull-down of 8.2 kohm or less. Fixed in stepping A3 (RP2350-DS)"],
    "sources": [{"title":"PICO-PINOUT: Raspberry Pi, Pico R3 A4 pinout (Pico-R3-A4-Pinout.pdf)","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/Pico-R3-A4-Pinout.pdf"},{"title":"PICOW-PINOUT: Raspberry Pi, Pico W A4 pinout (PicoW-A4-Pinout.pdf)","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/picow/PicoW-A4-Pinout.pdf"},{"title":"PICO-DS: Raspberry Pi, Raspberry Pi Pico Datasheet","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/pico-datasheet.pdf"},{"title":"PICOW-DS: Raspberry Pi, Raspberry Pi Pico W Datasheet","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/picow/pico-w-datasheet.pdf"},{"title":"PICO2-DS: Raspberry Pi, Raspberry Pi Pico 2 Datasheet (Figure 2 pinout)","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/pico/pico-2-datasheet.pdf"},{"title":"RP2040-DS: Raspberry Pi, RP2040 Datasheet (absolute maximum ratings)","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/rp2040/rp2040-datasheet.pdf"},{"title":"RP2350-DS: Raspberry Pi, RP2350 Datasheet (pin types, absolute maximum ratings, erratum RP2350-E9)","url":"https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/rp2350/rp2350-datasheet.pdf"}],
